// Workshop buildings (phase 5). All numbers are placeholders.
// work per tick = (base_work + staffed x work_per_necromancer) x (1 + level_bonus x (level - 1)), and 0 with no
// necromancer staffed: nothing runs on its own (base_work only adds while staffed).
// slots = base_slots + slots_per_level x (level - 1). Levels, max levels and upgrade costs: upgrades.json.
[
